  "body": "[![WhiteSource Renovate](https://app.renovatebot.com/images/banner.svg)](https://renovatebot.com)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [enzyme-adapter-preact-pure](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure) | [`2.2.0` -> `3.1.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/2.2.0/3.1.0) | [![age](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/3.1.0/age-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![adoption](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/3.1.0/adoption-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![passing](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/3.1.0/compatibility-slim/2.2.0)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![confidence](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/3.1.0/confidence-slim/2.2.0)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure</summary>\n\n### [`v3.1.0`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;310---2021-04-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v3.0.0...v3.1.0)\n\n-   Add support for [`invoke`](https://togithub.com/enzymejs/enzyme/blob/master/docs/api/ReactWrapper/invoke.md) wrapper method.\n    The Preact adapter currently only supports this for full (`mount`) rendering\n    [#&#8203;135](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/pull/135)\n\n### [`v3.0.0`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;300---2021-01-11)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v2.3.0...v3.0.0)\n\n-   This release removes support for Preact v8 to simplify ongoing maintenance.\n    See [#&#8203;117](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/issues/117).\n\n    Users of Preact v8 will need to either stick with the last 2.x release of this\n    package or upgrade their applications to Preact v10.\n\n### [`v2.3.0`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/releases/v2.3.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v2.2.3...v2.3.0)\n\n*nb. This was intended to have been a patch rather than minor release.*\n\n-   Fix error when setting certain event properties when calling `simulate()` in an environment that uses JSDOM [#&#8203;125](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/pull/125)\n\n### [`v2.2.3`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;223---2020-08-11)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v2.2.2...v2.2.3)\n\n-   Fix a regression in 2.2.1 when a component that is stubbed out during shallow\n    rendering is passed a number as a child [#&#8203;120](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/pull/120)\n\n### [`v2.2.2`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;222---2020-08-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v2.2.1...v2.2.2)\n\n-   Fix a regression in 2.2.1 when a component that is stubbed out during shallow\n    rendering is passed multiple children [#&#8203;119](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/pull/119)\n\n### [`v2.2.1`](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;221---2020-07-19)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/compare/v2.2.0...v2.2.1)\n\n-   Fix exception when shallow rendering a component that uses the \"render prop\"\n    pattern [#&#8203;107](https://togithub.com/preactjs/enzyme-adapter-preact-pure/pull/107).\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: \"after 4pm on friday,before 9am on monday,every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [WhiteSource Renovate](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com). View repository job log [here](https://app.renovatebot.com/dashboard#github/algolia/instantsearch.js).",
